# Civil Priest Velyr — scrub T2 basic duelist (HP 18, basic + limited powerful attack + limited powerful defend)

[title Civil Priest Velyr]
[image monsters/scrub_mage.png]
[stats hp=18]

* move Attack
  narration: He drives the butt of the staff at your ribs.
  narration: He sweeps the haft toward your knee.

* move Defend
  narration: He plants the staff and bends his knees, blade-end angled at your throat.

* move Recover
  narration: He steps back, breathing through his nose, finding his line.

* move Heavy Slow Attack
  narration: He sets his stance, takes a measured breath, and drives the staff in a hard descending arc.

* move Heavy Power Defend
  narration: He shifts his weight and brings the staff into a high guard, both hands locked.

* intro
The priest steps onto the path with the same composure he carries in the
courtyard. Plain robes, polished staff, that Kesharat formality. He inclines
his head, as if this were a courtesy call. Then his grip on the staff
changes, and you understand it isn't.

* win
+gold 14
+tag bested_velyr
He goes to one knee, then his hands, then he is still. The road is very
quiet. After a moment a desert lark starts up in the brush, and the world
remembers itself.

* lose
The staff finds your temple. Light, then nothing.
